    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Game Overview \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713370/extras/4a753b61c873612796647a0e3811b0ad.avif?t=1753678990\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that our protagonist is forced into another world, meets a cruel goddess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She gives him a \u201cHypnosis\u201d skill...and he puts it to full use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An isekai RPG where you screw every girl and angel you run into\u2014no hesitation, no mercy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hypnotized girls become loyal servants\u2014and follow you no matter what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, sneak into inns and churches with your 'companions'... and have sex right then and there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Story\u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713370/extras/f0d490e381585c7d5f64f31dda91820d.avif?t=1753678990\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Game Features \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfThe Ultimate Hypnosis Command!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it wisely\u2014this command works just once per adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One move. All the trash mobs\u2014gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713370/extras/5c0c3a6a9409a1abb5453410b47e42d3.avif?t=1753678990\" width=600 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfHave sex with  girls\u2014right on the spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No delay\u2014just hypnotize and fuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal the bond\u2014by finishing deep inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713370/extras/a85a50c1a4e55f6a635a1ebecf94db74.avif?t=1753678990\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfTrain them through sex at your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dark, your base becomes a private playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a blissful life of endless sex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wild sex\u2026 you can even change their looks and names!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfInherit and combine stats and skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have sex to share your power with your companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you fuck, the stronger they become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have sex while both of you have certain skills\u2026 and they might evolve!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Game System \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713370/extras/13afdd4ac8685d47b30e758c198d41ed.avif?t=1753678990\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfRoguelike System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are randomly generated every time you explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the map and find your way to the next exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden caves on the map are packed with treasure chests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to collect powerful gear and skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713370/extras/5f227d41a308a1ca8b0e76f67bb01c85.avif?t=1753678990\" width=600 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfSwap and Set Skills However You Like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely change the skills you use in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your setup to match your preferred playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfFast-Paced Combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lightning-fast battle system with rapid action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Auto-Battle to fight effortlessly and stay in control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfSweep the battlefield with Hypnosis!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a one-time Hypnosis skill during exploration to wipe out all enemies at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it smartly\u2014crush bosses or catch fleeing enemies fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Basic Information\u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Genre: Hypnosis Training RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Setting: Hypnotic Sex, Pleasure-Induced Corruption, Oral Sex, Breast Sex, ?????</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Production Software: RPG Maker MZ</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Original Art /B-\u9280\u6cb3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Color /\u308a\u3087\u3046\u306e\u30fbkou\u30fb\u5c71\u6751\u3046\u307f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Script /\u306a\u3084</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Director /\u306a\u3084</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Production /B-\u9280\u6cb3</p>",
